--  0160 — Khalidiyah's forms, the tables (the last 11; 0159's header), the
--         junctions, and what every table gets
--
--  GENERATED by supabase/khalidiyah/gen_schema.py. Do not edit.
--
--  Then, over all 23 tables and their 7 junctions at once: the standard
--  triggers (updated_at, audit, soft delete, no hard delete; audit alone on
--  a junction, which is replaced by delete-then-insert), RLS with the
--  municipality gate on USING and WITH CHECK, a DELETE policy on the
--  junctions and nowhere else (the seventh register row), and an index on
--  every foreign key that has none -- found from pg_constraint, so a key the
--  tables gain cannot be missed.
